{
  "name": "ImageStep recipe — templated cards: Sheet row → an HTML/CSS template rendered → JPEG → URL back",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## One card per sheet row from your HTML/CSS template\n\nEvery row you add to a Google Sheet becomes a 1080×1350 card that [ImageStep](https://imagestep.dev/?utm_source=n8n-templates&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=templated-cards) renders from your own HTML/CSS template, converts to JPEG and publishes, with the URL written back into the row. No model anywhere: the same row always makes the same card.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Google Sheets Trigger** picks up a new row (`brand`, `title`, `subtitle`, `price`, `cta`).\n2. **Render the Card** renders the saved template `promo-card` with the row's values in its `{{ var }}` placeholders. Templates render with JavaScript off and external requests blocked, so a card cannot change because a URL did.\n3. **To JPEG** converts the PNG to a JPEG (quality 88) and publishes it.\n4. **Write Back to the Row** puts the URL and the job id into the same row, matched on `row_number`.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the ImageStep node (`n8n-nodes-imagestep`) and add an ImageStep credential with an API key from [imagestep.dev/keys](https://imagestep.dev/keys?utm_source=n8n-templates&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=templated-cards).\n2. Save the `promo-card` template once: the [recipe's script](https://github.com/imagestep/imagestep-sdk/tree/main/recipes/templated-cards?utm_source=n8n-templates&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=templated-cards) saves its `card.html` and `card.css`.\n3. Make a sheet with the columns `brand`, `title`, `subtitle`, `price`, `cta`, `url` and `jobId`, and pick it in both Google Sheets nodes.\n\n### Customization tips\n- Edit `card.html` / `card.css` and run the script again: a changed byte saves the next template version, and every render job records the version it used.\n- Pictures a real run made: [imagestep.dev/docs/recipes](https://imagestep.dev/docs/recipes?utm_source=n8n-templates&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=templated-cards#templated-cards).",
        "height": 820,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-0010-4c00-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -660,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. A new row comes in\nEvery minute the trigger looks for rows added to the sheet. Each row needs `brand`, `title`, `subtitle`, `price` and `cta`.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-0011-4c00-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Render the template\nThe saved template `promo-card`, filled with this row. No model: the same row always makes the same card.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-0012-4c00-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. To JPEG\nThe rendered PNG becomes a JPEG, published with a stable URL.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-0013-4c00-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Sticky Note 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. URL back into the row\nThe card's URL and the job id go into the row that started it.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-0014-4c00-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Sticky Note 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "cachedResultName": "Promo cards"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gid=0",
          "cachedResultName": "Sheet1"
        },
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-0001-4c00-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Google Sheets Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsTriggerOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Google Sheets Trigger account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "op",
        "operation": "run",
        "op": "render_template",
        "inputMode": "none",
        "parameters": "={{ JSON.stringify({ templateId: 'promo-card', items: [{ brand: $json.brand, title: $json.title, subtitle: $json.subtitle, price: $json.price, cta: $json.cta }] }) }}",
        "dryRun": false,
        "storeResult": true,
        "wait": true,
        "waitSeconds": 120,
        "publish": false,
        "options": {
          "collection": "templated-cards"
        }
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-0002-4c00-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Render the Card",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-imagestep.imageStep",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "imageStepApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "ImageStep account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "op",
        "operation": "run",
        "op": "convert",
        "inputMode": "assetIds",
        "assetIds": "={{ $json.outputs[0].assetId }}",
        "parameters": "{\"format\": \"jpeg\", \"quality\": 88}",
        "dryRun": false,
        "storeResult": true,
        "wait": true,
        "waitSeconds": 60,
        "publish": true,
        "downloadOutput": false,
        "options": {
          "collection": "templated-cards"
        }
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-0003-4c00-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "To JPEG",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-imagestep.imageStep",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "imageStepApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "ImageStep account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
